Chapter: Thread

 Thread index type for GPU kernels. ThreadIndex is an opaque
 witness type. It gates access to DisjointSlice, ensuring parallel
 writes are provably disjoint at the type level. Construction
 from hardware registers happens via Device effect operations.

 We say:

Section: Types

  ThreadIndex = record {
    ti-value : Integer
  }

Section: Construction

  make-thread-index : Integer -> ThreadIndex
  make-thread-index (val) = ThreadIndex { ti-value = val }

Section: Access

  thread-index-get : ThreadIndex -> Integer
  thread-index-get (idx) = idx.ti-value

